content.text:
The degradation comes from one fault: ts-consign-service's database calls. Users hit it through ts-ui-dashboard.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-consign-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_status_code, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5),1) p50_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND span_name='SELECT ts.consign_record' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1",
          "claim": "Consign's DB SELECT on consign_record takes about 20-27 s p95 in the incident window, versus about 1 ms normally."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT level, message, count(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND (level IN ('SEVERE','WARN')) GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Consign logs show JDBCConnectionException and SQLState 08S01 errors, which appear only in the abnormal period."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_k8s_pod_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n, round(avg(duration/1e6),1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-consign-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4",
          "claim": "Consign's account endpoint returns HTTP 500 after about 26 s on 15 requests; other consign endpoints are unaffected."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-consign-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n, round(avg(duration/1e6),1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name LIKE '%consignservice/consigns/account%' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4 ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard's consign-account span inherits the 500s and about 19 s latency; loadgenerator sees 15 errored requests."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

